'''Reign of the Tyrant''' (大魔王ニャンダム大降臨, ''Daimaō Nyandamu Daikōrin'', '''Great Demon King Nyandam Great Advent''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]] and appears on the '''3rd''', '''4th''', '''17th''' and '''18th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. The first three stages yield nothing when completed, while the final stage drops the unit [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]].

