==Appears==
===English Version===
*The 3rd, 4th, 17th and 18th days in any month
*First appearance: July 28th, 2023 to August 1st, 2023

===Japanese Version===
*The 3rd, 4th, 17th and 18th days in any month
*First appearance: April 15th, 2023 to April 17th, 2023

